            "review_title": "Review at Bami King",
            "review_text": "Peter Crouch\nNew York City, New York5 contributions\n0\nGood regular place - November Hanoi\nNov 2018 • Friends\nWe went to this place probably three or four times. They have three different sandwiches. We liked the pork with BBQ sauce and the beef. This place is a good regular place, sort of in lieu of going to a burger joint (or like having a McRib). While we toured the city, we noticed there were a bunch. Not really a place to eat at, but good to pick up, and eat on the go.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 20, 2018",
