            "review_text": "Chloe_Nguyen83\n17 contributions\n0\nIt's worth trying\nMar 2018 • Solo\nMy friend recommended that i should eat Vietnam bread. I had bought a lot of sandwich but Bami King bread is the best. I ordered grill beef bread and it costs 35.000VND. Grill beef is very good which is combined with spicy sauce makes it's special. However, I have to take about 30 minutes for my order. It's really worth trying.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 4, 2018",
